# Docs stay current

Any behavior, API, UI, or privacy change updates the matching file under `docs/` in the **same change**. Add a `docs/changelog.md` entry.

- New lab → new `docs/labs/<name>.md` plus a catalog line in `docs/README.md`
- Architecture / ports / data flow → `docs/architecture.md`
- Retention, bind address, logging → `docs/privacy-and-security.md`
- Colors, mural, logo → `docs/design-system.md`
- Why we chose something → `docs/decisions.md`

Do not leave README claims that the running app no longer matches.
